ivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/ACw721vOZ2pE6LPQxXNjZqTuutjafptZ.ogg"},{"description":"Airi_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"老师，谢谢你一直都那么照顾我。","text_original":"いつもありがとうございます。先生。えへへっ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/pT71VZrWDoBUMS6nvi39CI5XCL8uGkwV.ogg"},{"description":"Airi_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"啦啦~最喜欢甜食了~","text_original":"ルンルン～甘いの大好き～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/5XaakpgbzcjwA1JKzS9ZDuOWgzNXxhBM.ogg"},{"description":"Airi_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师您也喜欢冰淇淋吧？对吧？","text_original":"先生もアイスクリーム好きですよね？ね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/TCaEQrXshiGKmCPtLvTQ1vZjLg1J6Emu.ogg"},{"description":"Airi_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"回家路上就是甜点时间~","text_original":"放課後はスイーツタイム～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/q6f49ac9CQg9m5ZdOkNpOiVq9RbrH2q1.ogg"},{"description":"Airi_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"为了好吃的甜点～今天也一起加油吧！","text_original":"おいしいスイーツのため～今日も一緒に頑張りましょう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/iYC68QHxFa7crNavVhZ8nHrWUtbB9d0F.ogg"},{"description":"Airi_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？老师。看您好像有什么心事。","text_original":"ん？先生。何か悩みがありそうな顔ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/75XIRo08qPvmiehYQVYFxGwm7Yrhf6UU.ogg"},{"description":"Airi_Lobby_6","category":"lobby","text":"这种时候啊，来来！一起去吃美味的甜点吧！","text_original":"そういう時は、さあさあ！美味しいスイーツを食べに！一緒に行きましょう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/8co1SjTL98hYrw7pT0n8YZt6KUTaREkk.ogg"},{"description":"Airi_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师~您回来了~今天也会一起去吃甜点对吧？","text_original":"先生～、お帰りなさい。今日も一緒にスイーツ食べに行きますよね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/l8KYgzSOU4a58WiOofS4YI4aGhO8Rwst.o