忙的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/DeSHAn72NXcuRkjlD7lWCI30jRRNC9z3.ogg"},{"description":"airi_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"今天也要加油！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/ZLCaNubD55xeNWe6DEg9OGqmQ7ldVpAq.ogg"},{"description":"airi_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"很开心能认识您，老师～老师喜欢什么口味的冰淇淋呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/AfqZZ1mLx2wb2ssnRfTS0cpWPidC2FQF.ogg"},{"description":"airi_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"老师，谢谢您！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/SPHilVT3GKR0XO7NQE0xRpXJf8tHoyhD.ogg"},{"description":"airi_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"诶嘿，可以多依靠我一点哦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/JNqQHBVzp5axlk94LtfIPmWpYGhUoZI9.ogg"},{"description":"airi_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"锵！我变强了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/V4jL2ysHVwVxPjnxXu85osxLlx1mrSpo.ogg"},{"description":"airi_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"老师，谢谢你一直都那么照顾我。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/5qlcHBTVn2Go5zAyZ2Zb4jKfrCRdso4l.ogg"},{"description":"airi_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"啦啦~最喜欢甜食了~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/f3SXyb6xWybQon2ZX83u9jjFPnCb3dez.ogg"},{"description":"airi_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师您也喜欢冰淇淋吧？对吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%91%20%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%89/pT6OpLtiy20RNyTWhmXgrfdXjSKesRdM.ogg"},{"description":"airi_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"回家路上就是甜点时间~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6